<title>INDONESIA: INCO sees early Jan start of furnace.</title>
<headline>INCO sees early Jan start of furnace.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT International Nickel Indonesia (INCO), majority-owned by Inco Ltd, said on Wednesday its electric furnace which was hit by a blast last month would be fully operational only in early January.</p>
<p>Ray Westall, INCO vice-president and chief financial officer, told Reuters the explosion would cut the company's nickel production by at least five million pounds.</p>
</text>
